{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Silent Chamber</i> is a first-person psychological horror adventure about <strong>stealth, survival,</strong> and the <strong>search for lost relics</strong> hidden within <strong>nightmarish locations and ancient depths.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Kate, a woman bound by a dark bargain that leads her into places no living soul should ever tread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/90cd9471f51709e0bd821d6ecb347afd.poster.avif?t=1765124142\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/90cd9471f51709e0bd821d6ecb347afd.webm?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/90cd9471f51709e0bd821d6ecb347afd.mp4?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORYLINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In return for supernatural favors, Kate must recover <strong>forbidden relics</strong> concealed within <strong>abandoned estates and forgotten buildings</strong>\u2014each containing an ancient magic sought by a dark wizard for reasons he keeps secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her search eventually leads her <strong>beneath the surface</strong>, into a <strong>hellish underworld</strong> where something precious waits to be saved. But nothing there is what it seems, and Kate soon realizes that no one returns from this place unchanged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/fb3799e707a3ebe89a290da82e6efa70.poster.avif?t=1765124142\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/fb3799e707a3ebe89a290da82e6efa70.webm?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/fb3799e707a3ebe89a290da82e6efa70.mp4?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore haunted environments, uncover cryptic clues, and solve  puzzles tied to lost rituals.<br>Use <strong>stealth and sound</strong> to survive what hunts in the dark \u2014 every step, every breath, can give you away.<br>Collect relics, read forgotten journals, and uncover the dark history of the places you explore and the people (and things) who inhabit them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/893e28cc14d21821e0cb6b69c584c6ae.poster.avif?t=1765124142\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/893e28cc14d21821e0cb6b69c584c6ae.webm?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/893e28cc14d21821e0cb6b69c584c6ae.mp4?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/5e8710443c6c34401f86c24412b4fc27.poster.avif?t=1765124142\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/5e8710443c6c34401f86c24412b4fc27.webm?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/5e8710443c6c34401f86c24412b4fc27.mp4?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse dark, oppressive environments filled with occult symbols, ancient ruins, and forbidden rituals. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter mysterious and unsettling characters, each with their own motives and hidden truths. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ferocious monsters, demonic entities, and terrifying mimics lurking in the shadows.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uncover old rivalries between powerful wizards and the forces they once tried to control.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a world steeped in decay, dread, and the lingering presence of something watching.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/05df4175784bbbb1e3311e8d1333eb81.poster.avif?t=1765124142\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/05df4175784bbbb1e3311e8d1333eb81.webm?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/05df4175784bbbb1e3311e8d1333eb81.mp4?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121870?t=1765124142","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/3c3e4cff4acc71817bcbaf1506d1de475599217b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765124142","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/9f610aeda2ad24bad620fa8e224466e9e70a37b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765124142","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/9f610aeda2ad24bad620fa8e224466e9e70a37b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765124142","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror themes, frightening imagery, blood, and depictions of bones and corpses. Certain scenes include veiled non-sexual nudity in the form of a ghostly apparition. It also features references to alcohol and tobacco use and disturbing supernatural content that may not be suitable for all audiences."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Silent Chamber</i> is a first-person psychological horror adventure about <strong>stealth, survival,</strong> and the <strong>search for lost relics</strong> hidden within <strong>nightmarish locations and ancient depths.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Kate, a woman bound by a dark bargain that leads her into places no living soul should ever tread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/90cd9471f51709e0bd821d6ecb347afd.poster.avif?t=1765124142\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/90cd9471f51709e0bd821d6ecb347afd.webm?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/90cd9471f51709e0bd821d6ecb347afd.mp4?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORYLINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In return for supernatural favors, Kate must recover <strong>forbidden relics</strong> concealed within <strong>abandoned estates and forgotten buildings</strong>\u2014each containing an ancient magic sought by a dark wizard for reasons he keeps secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her search eventually leads her <strong>beneath the surface</strong>, into a <strong>hellish underworld</strong> where something precious waits to be saved. But nothing there is what it seems, and Kate soon realizes that no one returns from this place unchanged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/fb3799e707a3ebe89a290da82e6efa70.poster.avif?t=1765124142\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/fb3799e707a3ebe89a290da82e6efa70.webm?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/fb3799e707a3ebe89a290da82e6efa70.mp4?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore haunted environments, uncover cryptic clues, and solve  puzzles tied to lost rituals.<br>Use <strong>stealth and sound</strong> to survive what hunts in the dark \u2014 every step, every breath, can give you away.<br>Collect relics, read forgotten journals, and uncover the dark history of the places you explore and the people (and things) who inhabit them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/893e28cc14d21821e0cb6b69c584c6ae.poster.avif?t=1765124142\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/893e28cc14d21821e0cb6b69c584c6ae.webm?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/893e28cc14d21821e0cb6b69c584c6ae.mp4?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/5e8710443c6c34401f86c24412b4fc27.poster.avif?t=1765124142\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/5e8710443c6c34401f86c24412b4fc27.webm?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121870/extras/5e8710443c6c34401f86c24412b4fc27.mp4?t=1765124142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse dark, oppressive environments filled with occult symbols, ancient ruins, and forbidden rituals. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter mysterious and unsettling characters, each with their own motives and hidden truths. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ferocious monsters, demonic entities, and terrifying mimics lurking in the shadows.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uncover old rivalries between powerful wizards and the forces they once tried to control.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a world steeped in decay, dread, and the lingering presence of something watching.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c